{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1147882-thank-you-opp-forums","id":1147882,"title":"THANK YOU OPP FORUMS!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-10-07T16:16:43-07:00","id":1147882,"title":"THANK YOU OPP FORUMS!","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/yv5dxbm.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/yv5dxbm.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/yv5dxbm.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"> https://i.imgur.com/yv5dxbm.jpg </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> id post the image but to baked to resize the fucking thing.<br /> <br /> I met <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar380_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"380\" data-vbnamecard=\"380\">AzraelFirestorm</a> over three years ago here on o tje ofd topic thread. We became amazing friends so instantly it was honestly shocking. He accepts me as i am, the quirky insane little malk thats a whirlwind of emotion on her best days. 10 days ago i boarded a plane to New Mexico. It was supposed to be a mini vacaction to meet a good friend and to rhink about life. I chose to stay.<br /> <br /> All my fears that he woulsnt like me out side of skype quite quickly vanished as his aunt drove me to what would become my new home. And i realized his family is just so much like me.<br /> <br /> as for me and Az. My soul feels complete again, like a vital piece that had been missing has been found. He is beyond what my dreams imagined.<br /> <br /> thank you opp without this place we would never have met, and fallen in a love that just works.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\"><span style=\"color:#ee82ee\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><i><u>Follow me on twitter! <a href=\"https://twitter.com/scelestai\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/scelestai</a></u></i></b></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":897,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","user":"Scelesta","date":". 10-07-2017, 07:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":12}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","name":"Scelesta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"551"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-07T16:59:04-07:00","id":1147885,"title":"","content":"I thought that I'd have something more to add, but I find myself struck almost speechless. I suppose that makes sense, in a way. I don't have to keep talking just to fill the lonely silence. I'm not alone anymore. The quiet moments aren't full of silence anymore. They're full of a quiet feeling of safety and love I could have never before imagined.<br /> <br /> Life... I usually don't like surprises, or change, because it's usually for the worse. Not this time. Things have changed, and for the better. I finally have the other half of my heart.<br /> <br /> Like the (absolutely wonderful) OP said in the tin:<br /> <br /> Thanks, OPP forums. I wouldn't have found the love of my life without this place and the encouragement from the friends we've both made here.<br /> <br /> - Az","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-07T17:06:57-07:00","id":1147889,"title":"","content":"I wish all the happiness t\u00f4 you both","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-07T18:32:11-07:00","id":1147906,"title":"","content":"Congratulations and the best to the both of you. Sometimes we find a piece that feels like it was missing from us all along, and that can happen anywhere, at any time.<br /> <br /> Go into it for the long haul. Keep communication open with one another, and be ready to shoulder burdens and be patient. Love is long if you make it so.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.pn